<title>UK: UK cost pressures subdued, UK Treasury says.</title>
<headline>UK cost pressures subdued, UK Treasury says.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costs pressures in the UK economy remain subdued, the British Treasury said today.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said goods and services inflation was testament to the strength of retail competition.  </p>
<p>INFLATION DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>=====================</p>
<p>UK SEPT RPI +0.5% MM +2.1% YY, RPIX +0.5% MM +2.9% YY, RPIY +0.6% MM +2.5%YY</p>
<p>ONS SAYS 5.2% MM INCREASE IN CLOTHING AND FOOTWEAR PRICES, HIGHEST ON RECORD</p>
<p>-- John Speck, London Newsroom +44 171 542-8663</p>
</text>
